{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_title", "source_sha256": "570e9c062c05c1866b75d5897601de6accc9a27b1081886617d0503ca778ba0b", "ja": "あの光のように", "zh": "如同那道光一样", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8f6544ec94885d24191b73e40b4fffc47c29dcfcf3f261e129dd3f24e79ca70d", "ja": "新曲のレッスンを頑張る約束で、翼はプロデ\nューサーとデートする。みんなが眩しいと語\nる翼のため、プロデューサーはメンバーに、\nメインを食うつもりでやってくれと提案。そ\nして公演当日、翼は誰よりも輝くのだった。", "zh": "翼以努力练习新歌为约定，和制作人\n去约会。为了觉得大家都很耀眼的翼，\n制作人向成员们提议，让他们抱着抢走\n主角风头的势头去表演。随后在公演当天，\n翼绽放出了比任何人都更加耀眼的光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6baa95028632c9e20449782ef0b24e57749445dda47d79f2c71ee33e5f8e0f17", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！\nこっち、こっちですよ～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！\n这边，这边哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1001_p", "source_sha256": "40e231854916c150e7663faff7200d9ac25001552f0470234091d549e06d12cd", "ja": "わかった、わかった。\nところで翼、どこに行くつもりなんだ？", "zh": "知道了，知道了。\n话说翼，你打算去哪儿啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "974af7aef4ba2a503436cf441b8f00ea277e5846642950c005a565a8773e6bea", "ja": "この先の、アクセサリーのお店です♪\n最近できたばっかで、気になってたんですよね～。", "zh": "是前面的饰品店♪\n那家店最近才开，我一直挺在意的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "706710c42e8c50fed519879046b43a04aab1f579c185c8612d9108d304429ea2", "ja": "あとは、美希ちゃんたちがお仕事してた\nコスメブランドのお店に行って～。その次は……。", "zh": "然后去美希她们工作过的化妆品品牌店～接下来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9b05d48f2b48f9ef5e1e526578188f7900335bc7ce5ee1042f17a191d9186b66", "ja": "あっ！　あのスカート、カワイイ～！\n{$P$}さん、こっち～！", "zh": "啊！那条裙子好可爱～！\n{$P$}先生，这边这边～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1005_p", "source_sha256": "521a7253fb05026a140f3585cd5a4a89700b4ab6dafe1fa616f24343ffefa2bf", "ja": "え？　……お～い、翼！\nアクセサリーのお店はいいのか～！", "zh": "诶？……喂——翼！\n不去看饰品店了吗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4dba2f4af709272fedb9e1e23d0e25fd23ccefac38035810503fa9a676644bf4", "ja": "（翼に引っ張り回……連れられて、色んな店を回った。\n気がつけば、両手にはたくさんの荷物が……）", "zh": "（被翼拉着跑……带着逛了各种店。回过神来，双手已经提满了东西……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "01bf976aeb41ec3371a44ed20aaf32e0d8160a576ae2c7b04239699532210d5f", "ja": "ふぅ、ちょっと休憩！\n……うん♪　タピオカミルクティー、おいしい～♪", "zh": "呼，稍微休息一下！\n……嗯♪珍珠奶茶真好喝～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "94b1af96080465eb9f21657f77e0bef6d055c150b830506471af2a4b103a029d", "ja": "でもでも、{$P$}さんの\nタピオカジャスミンティーも気になるな～。", "zh": "不过不过，我也很在意{$P$}先生的珍珠茉莉茶呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bc5da7b8ac7eb50147b2310a35c1848c31433a6b9e18afed6ca9d419496429d2", "ja": "わたしにも、ひと口くださ～い！", "zh": "也分我喝一口嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1011_p", "source_sha256": "af6c8682ff3418a4e89481134fc008a0f87792d2e66733512bdb8176f9101e24", "ja": "また今度な。それより、そろそろ劇場に戻らないと。\n今日から新曲のレッスンだろ？", "zh": "下次吧。比起这个，差不多该回剧场了。\n今天不是要开始新歌的练习了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "10140d089666f62d95b955dc2ad60f6c69037fcd245bd590a004dbd25511e625", "ja": "あっ、バレちゃった……えへへ。\nわかりました！　これ飲んだら帰りま～す。", "zh": "啊，被发现啦……诶嘿嘿。\n我知道啦！喝完这个我就回去～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f24fa763a47725242a9326c913c5e521943b993876391cbebbdcadee7f1d66ce", "ja": "{$P$}さんとデート、\nすっごく楽しかった～♪", "zh": "和{$P$}先生约会，真的超级开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cf4ce7fc086f0a20d3a0c5c1f30aa0ad870afc963be9818f6399f594cd67d279", "ja": "毎日、デートできたらいいのにな～。\nあとは……お買い物が、レッスンとか！？", "zh": "要是每天都能约会就好了呢～。\n还有……把购物当成练习之类的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1015_p", "source_sha256": "787e72c68c612b0497291405a3544705d98cfb25b010d5af023c7ca2b7ca4b8a", "ja": "どんなレッスンなんだ……\nそれより翼、そんなにレッスンが嫌なのか？", "zh": "那是什么样的练习啊……\n话说回来，翼，你就那么讨厌练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e8e2f8691dcba1b6055db54a2df8b33ddd2ccfac4186171a5e399ee2a87dee01", "ja": "イヤっていうか……\nレッスンって、同じことの繰り返しじゃないですか～。", "zh": "与其说是讨厌……  \n练习不就是一遍遍重复同样的事情嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9081af35d2e22e3f01dde637d716db908c00ce0e36504972b8681a464e003986", "ja": "あとは汗かくし、疲れるし、めんどくさいし！", "zh": "而且还会出汗、会累、还很麻烦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7e66ac8f21d226d63c89956ca0b53bb1691850e535b8a46ea484259c7c378db2", "ja": "でも前よりは、ちょっとだけ楽しいかも？\nホントに、ちょっとだけですけど！", "zh": "不过，比起以前，或许稍微开心了一点？\n真的，只有一点点而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1019_p", "source_sha256": "840fd1afb36ae25e1739f9d647cd5aa7a74705b9a0c7a30614fde9a308a74f3d", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか？", "zh": "这样啊，是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "da64e195df58213d457a0d837aa20fd15a755c62fc968ee750b146d8b9953a7a", "ja": "うん！　わたし、バックダンサーしたでしょ？\n美希ちゃんの公演で……。", "zh": "嗯！我不是当过伴舞吗？\n在美希的公演上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "68513487a6259acfc123efd5fb31e59114a1f6452ac0d0d6611a86c98a7dc4a1", "ja": "あの時、美希ちゃんが言ってたことが、ずっと\n気になってたんですよ～。", "zh": "那时候，美希说过的话，我一直很在意～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3af39d2bc7d6387b8fe1bafbf41887873fefb9a7a43bd31b05fa932b9bc95b2d", "ja": "{$P$}さんも言ってましたよね？\n「一瞬だけ、全力で本気を出した」って。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也说过吧？\n“只有那一瞬间，拼尽全力认真了一把。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f673b1a4aefe49dc704d56c5fabed9c9e4288830aaf5eccc6b7befb472e14ced", "ja": "ああ、うん。そんな事言ったな。", "zh": "啊，对，我确实说过那种话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d6abc8369c372493d62606a9886b6e427f75675f3bf0481346184786942a13cd", "ja": "わたし、美希ちゃんって本気とかじゃなく、なんでも\n余裕でできちゃうと思ってたから、意外で……。", "zh": "我还以为美希不管什么事都不用认真，\n随随便便就能做到呢，所以觉得很意外……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a28d04a1f79b04fd87040a40322a222cddf881d325c99020e75fdb0b56fe4a63", "ja": "そのせいなのかな～？　最近、\n劇場のみんなのことが、気になってきちゃったんです。", "zh": "是因为这个吗～？最近，我开始有点在意剧场里的大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0188af7c8779d9a1a507a4673afbd3906618893a42ef44caae1a2c48f4e5f06d", "ja": "劇場のみんなの事が気になる……？\nそれは、どんな風に？", "zh": "开始在意剧场里的大家了……？\n具体是怎样的在意呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b64d25c8a3581cef49f5ae08dcf224ba1ae8e14297aef7a9a58dfc254933fc7d", "ja": "えっと……一番不思議だったのは、\nみんなが、キラキラしてることかな？", "zh": "那个……最不可思议的，是大家都在闪闪发光吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "024d1d715866ae58379e5491bb7e233273c3f0006b7a08053983847e0f6a86ab", "ja": "アイドルって、レッスンが多くて大変だし。\n他のお仕事も、覚えることがいっぱいあるのに……。", "zh": "偶像的训练很多，很辛苦。\n明明其他工作也有好多东西要学……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "01f56f805e47bd1099bb2aab8f0aa6b8936beadcfe6f1e78bdf5c62921f5c002", "ja": "大変なこととか、できないことの練習をがんばってて。\nきついのに、でもみんな、なんか、楽しそう……。", "zh": "都在努力去练辛苦的事、做不到的事。\n明明那么累，但大家不知怎的，看起来都好开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1030_p", "source_sha256": "e72bca5bea14b18312e68d2a0d104c1f8ef1d75a70810dae58f2ad21852993e1", "ja": "翼……。", "zh": "翼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "43db1f886bf91a265896ade31f4b301dfd354bbd8b1744415e6fbec90d3f1a5f", "ja": "だからわたし、みんなに聞いてみたんです！\n「どうしてそんなにがんばるの？」って。", "zh": "所以我就去问了大家！\n“为什么要那么努力呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7694e692304d5748cd95f33212caac8bb16a9ce2a7a70fc16c51b966e0410b80", "ja": "雪歩さんは「がんばらないと、私はダメダメだから」\nって言って、桃子ちゃんは「桃子はプロだから」って。", "zh": "雪步姐说：“因为不努力的话，我就一无是处。”\n桃子说：“因为桃子可是专业的。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ecc257bdd8497fe7cbf94f9dfa013f01eeadbc67be4496d366f4e20518510546", "ja": "千鶴さんは「セレブの役目ですわ！」って言うし。\n亜利沙さんは、長くて忘れちゃったけど……。", "zh": "千鹤说：“这是名媛的职责呀！”  \n至于亚利沙嘛，她说得太长了，我已经忘了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "732b3a20445f22064e0cf6aeb13f6b69c9c0a8b6ba04b1b223ad10f1d2c7504b", "ja": "恵美さんは「なんでだろ？　楽しいから？」だって！\nわたし、もっとわからなくなってきちゃった……。", "zh": "惠美则是说“为什么呢？因为很开心吧？”！\n我都越来越搞不懂了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1035_p", "source_sha256": "24621aab14cf4a333de927f0346e643476b5a5162a8d5e23be7011e74c234dc0", "ja": "ははは、そうか。\nそれで……翼は、どうしたいんだ？", "zh": "哈哈哈，这样啊。\n那么……翼，你想怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c295c2482ac467cd71c59d39e8f0d8102f654d3b4ca1b6fa6ce2ea541133d24d", "ja": "わたしですか？　わたしは……\nわたしも、みんなみたいにキラキラしたい……かも。", "zh": "问我吗？我其实……\n我也想像大家一样闪闪发光……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1037_p", "source_sha256": "8aae78654b885f72f7723ea8c0b49674dfdecd77a59ce9a1a90804cbf595a8d1", "ja": "そうか。……翼もみんなと同じように、\n努力しようとしてるんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。……翼也在努力，想变得和大家一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c3dc59f1bab406dae915dc443383da1c495dc2020d38ae565ad22769e97763f0", "ja": "えっ？　……そうなの？\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "诶？……是这样吗？\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1039_p", "source_sha256": "bdaf93e4a05d86978dffc3ab9237857bba37248d29dd71c7fe950b2ee8e97902", "ja": "うん、そうだと思う。そうやって悩むのは、\n翼なりに、前に進もうとしてる証拠じゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得是这样。会像这样烦恼，或许正是翼在用自己的方式努力向前迈进的证明吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1714df951d9f11154ae6ed899638c412b4d1de358469899284b0ceee06febd5a", "ja": "わたしなりに……。", "zh": "我自己的方式……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1041_p", "source_sha256": "b3163dd69cfab4d161dd4b8800f62c85bfdbeebe6c25e8d15e086021d3cc9b1e", "ja": "翼。相談なんだけど……今度の新曲を披露する公演、\nバックダンサーに、響と美希も呼んでみないか？", "zh": "翼，我想和你商量件事……这次要表演新歌的公演，要不要也请响和美希来当伴舞？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1042_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7aa76bd428f0abf0caf07899b067c7916c9f5dde465733c2b3ff2a8cd6bcde43", "ja": "えっ！？　響さんと、美希ちゃんを？", "zh": "诶！？要请响小姐和美希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e222e6780e45d5d376655e8a365d359da21bcecf65ec42537d2ee97c217219fa", "ja": "ダメですよ～！　わたしの新曲なのに、\n美希ちゃんと響さんの方がわたしより目立っちゃう～！", "zh": "不行啦～！明明是我的新歌，\n结果美希和响反而比我更抢眼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1044_p", "source_sha256": "598d774f695909abb8a641cfe305c6ca3cc90d5c3fb90a710fb0b470c3fc1874", "ja": "そうだな。響の持ち味は、レベルの高いダンスだ。\n美希の魅力は……まあ、翼もよくわかってるよな。", "zh": "是啊。响的特点就是高水平的舞蹈。\n美希的魅力嘛……翼也很清楚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1045_p", "source_sha256": "4a02e8ba3ef26368fc86001ef0cff5dbdd9ccb8486469c85f0bac399257905e2", "ja": "でも、だからこそ……\n最高のステージになる、って思わないか？", "zh": "可是，正因如此……你不觉得会成为最棒的舞台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1047_p", "source_sha256": "bd95d376d5506e04a839b99f92d60b8843ff801078eeb9e5b9413932c9bbb494", "ja": "ステージで披露するのは、翼の曲だ。\n翼が、誰よりも輝くための曲なんだよ。", "zh": "在舞台上表演的，是翼的歌曲。\n是为了让翼比任何人都更加闪耀的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1048_p", "source_sha256": "224743e682b3855cf6e04d900a5ce88ea164d0551061bc7e05dc1bb641d3fdcb", "ja": "美希や響よりも、キラキラするために……\n挑戦してみないか？", "zh": "为了比美希和响更加闪耀……\n要不要挑战一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1050_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1af190f2d024596568a2d5897603370cfda0d94e60e5bbfc533f3bf95954387d", "ja": "あれ……なんだろう？\nそんなの、ダメって思ったのに……。", "zh": "奇怪……这是怎么回事？\n明明觉得那样是不行的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1051_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1d3d80dfcaf01c9a252e91eee9c09138af1dd19041e87af22bb4975ea7d5b06a", "ja": "でも……。\nわたし、ドキドキしてる……。", "zh": "可是……\n我的心跳得好快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1052_p", "source_sha256": "e8dd519a00445559d186fb9629d2816e599052055a268edb0863e3d68dbc5c48", "ja": "……うん。そうみたいだな。", "zh": "……嗯。看起来是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1053_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1324dd8a5020b1acc59a82e36ade2b0f8f38f41a347f6015d99be321fe206ce3", "ja": "{$P$}さん。わたし、新しい曲で\n響さんと美希ちゃんより、キラキラできると思う？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。你觉得在新歌里，\n我能比响小姐和美希更有光芒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_1054", "source_sha256": "99d3cb0c128c908713de7c3f805f040459ac97a187c1612d8f4a050d98823585", "ja": "思う！", "zh": "觉得是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2000_p", "source_sha256": "46d542041a3e417df4613db84487b3a4481f405c08258e814b0f68497e715880", "ja": "もちろん、思うよ。\nだから言ってみたんだ。", "zh": "当然这么想啊。\n所以我才说出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0d76d65c6f828a0c5eeb2cbaa551a05962fb73d84fda03dec24d13949ce0ccaf", "ja": "うん……わかった。わたし、\n美希ちゃんと響さんと一緒に、ステージやる！", "zh": "嗯……知道了。我会和美希、小响一起登台演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2002_p", "source_sha256": "bd47c31d0186c732c4857820297cd506282d950727ebcdda28a63f44904b105d", "ja": "その意気だ！\nそれじゃ、早速ふたりに連絡して……。", "zh": "这才对嘛！那就马上联系她们俩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2004_047sub", "source_sha256": "e026829efdfec009334f0a517f48c292d4ed02a8e35e57f5a64f13060e6f752c", "ja": "翼、{$P$}、遅かったな！\nふたりとも、どこ行ってたんだよ？", "zh": "翼、{$P$}，你们来晚了啊！\n你们两个刚才去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2ba4b9137e9f133b6824eed7623cd8571bd41ccda65689e33b8a52b085c01dfa", "ja": "ただいま、昴くん♪　えへへ、\n{$P$}さんと遊んできちゃった。", "zh": "我回来了，昴♪　嘿嘿，\n刚和{$P$}先生一起玩了一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2006_047sub", "source_sha256": "544c935fcf92583a61bce16e1143dca1f8f6ac80c27dd03563772eb62c1d9507", "ja": "遊んで？　あ、もしかしてデートか！？\nなあ翼、そうなんだろ？　どこ行ったんだよ～？", "zh": "玩？啊，难道是约会！？\n喂，翼，是这样吧？你们去哪儿了啊～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5fe271e87bbb565ecc9ba2b9568101dedb66edea61be51736e05615303fc8488", "ja": "えっと……ヒミツ！\nですよね～、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "那个……秘密！\n对吧～，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "24e011f24b870e97585ecb53482cbfdeb8f80f576808dff7a0de235326d1b82b", "ja": "新曲と引き換えに、本当に伊吹さんとデート……！\nあなたには、分別というものが無いのですか！？", "zh": "用新歌换来的，居然真的能和伊吹小姐约会……！\n您难道就没有一点分寸吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2009_p", "source_sha256": "f6160c359e3eedfe9c64af93478bad3e617423b5c19ce2a5bb0be629c5e2e03e", "ja": "いや、これで分別の塊というか……\nあ、もうこんな時間か。ふたりはもう来てるかな？", "zh": "不，正因为这样才算懂得分寸吧……\n啊，都这个时间了。那两个人已经到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2010_047sub", "source_sha256": "06772573bc43c186139ddfa9e4a9742af084e1be0a225b38e15e79d828a6d48f", "ja": "ふたり？", "zh": "两个人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2012_013hib", "source_sha256": "987033e5544cf637b2f1a5e15385b98bc4a8803a93c06aab49ab37b1e6f1f8f0", "ja": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8！\nふぅ、これで準備運動はバッチリだね！", "zh": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8！\n呼，这样热身运动就完美啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2013_003mik", "source_sha256": "41a36a98e404d27b6715fbe2936b132bb6626395c78e3b28f50b8ded1197837e", "ja": "うん。それじゃミキ、{$P$}が\n来るまでお昼寝してるね。", "zh": "嗯。那美希在{$P$}来之前\n先睡个午觉哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2014_013hib", "source_sha256": "697f7d7f04a50ee2b171fca9d7459c342f7a3249903fd4fbaef8d1bcbdf43b04", "ja": "えっ？　美希、ここで寝るの！？\n体痛くならない？", "zh": "诶？美希要睡在这里吗！？身体不会疼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2015_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "333c3d719f1e4f65af2ace21c537f32dc6a46d74fb9507529c43f80a6b5f7f47", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす！　あっ、美希ちゃんと響さん！\nもう着いたんですね！", "zh": "辛苦啦——！啊，美希和响！\n你们已经到了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2017_013hib", "source_sha256": "a5123520683b166c3f2648ea6a063aac646fbd0ae0d5f89be8283a90b610a81a", "ja": "うん！\n自分も美希も、さっき来たところだぞ！", "zh": "嗯！\n我和美希也是刚刚才到的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2018_p", "source_sha256": "d129a3899f251e5a774cd9af596dbefa7fe24aa677e0e308fd9a9373fa62c240", "ja": "響、美希、お疲れさま。\nふたりとも、急に呼び出したりして悪かったな。", "zh": "响、美希，辛苦了。\n突然把你们两个叫过来，真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2019_013hib", "source_sha256": "0763c23654ec28626a121672d366b5bc4cc11c0113c612e20410bcc4f98f5f35", "ja": "自分は大丈夫！　写真だけで全然動いてないから、\n体を動かしたくてウズウズしてたんだ！", "zh": "我没事！只是拍照，完全没怎么动，所以早就按捺不住想活动活动身体了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eace885ee101dcc09b30c12b2ea7f77ca752d737cb467cbec2ca7cb27be6cf35", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\n星井さんと我那覇さんが、どうしてここに？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n星井小姐和我那霸小姐怎么会在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2021_p", "source_sha256": "18a5225397e52b6b825eb160fa7d842f6c4a13573c829a37ee9f7bedc248fa42", "ja": "それも含めて、これから説明するよ。\nみんなに、頼みたい事があるんだ。", "zh": "包括这些在内，我接下来会说明的。\n我有件事想拜托大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2022_047sub", "source_sha256": "0eae67f7b7487910a5538126f8201f98a81c6e766b451908302ca790f549e41a", "ja": "頼みたいこと？", "zh": "想拜托大家的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2023_p", "source_sha256": "37249878dd3621b84cd106cdabc8df53b174d33b84c2c6cac7bc1b359e99cd60", "ja": "うん。今度の公演で、みんなに\n翼の新曲のバックダンサーを務めてほしい。", "zh": "嗯。下次的演出，我希望大家\n来为翼的新曲担任伴舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2024_p", "source_sha256": "c78a83e44ff3190cb455fd5ccc269f0befcc0a86cfc6430249e57da7d826a03c", "ja": "ただし……\n全員、翼より目立つつもりでやってほしいんだ。", "zh": "不过……\n\n我希望大家演出时，都抱着要比翼更引人注目的打算。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
