{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b6bf4a62d44506179053146c27a81e4caaf48d5bc1427d54c11d96ca41b02444", "ja": "何を言っているのですか？\nバックダンサーのほうが目立つなんて、そんな……。", "zh": "你在说什么呀？\n怎么能让伴舞比主角还抢眼呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2029_003mik", "source_sha256": "c3f4c85591c0c4d2c6596eed10f459969fe2a5b32f31832094ee6084fadc9cd9", "ja": "……あはっ、面白そうかも。\n{$P$}、わかったの♪", "zh": "……啊哈，好像挺有意思的呢。\n{$P$}，美希明白了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2030_013hib", "source_sha256": "6da7ce5180be2b1b39a8b8ec50697186088a2ee8c20756c9083832a16fd9f289", "ja": "ええっ！？　美希、何言ってるのー！？\n翼の新曲で、初公演なんだぞ！？　それを……。", "zh": "诶！？美希，你在说什么呀——！？\n这可是翼的新歌首次公演啊！？怎么能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
