{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2035_003mik", "source_sha256": "e0643aadac41bd9e1d73b5c71c68c59edb1777c8879b168729b0a81491036273", "ja": "なら、それでいいってカンジ！\n響も昴くんも紬も、エンリョすることないって思うな。", "zh": "那样就正合适啦！\n我觉得响、昴，还有紬，都没必要客气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2036_p", "source_sha256": "3df6f1f7f6121106101607ebbb47d2dd6e78ca6fd5d00c979b75787bbfeb441a", "ja": "そういう事だ。みんな、自分がバックダンサーだと\n思わずに、思いっきりやってほしい！", "zh": "就是这样。大家不要把自己当成伴舞，尽情发挥吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2037_013hib", "source_sha256": "2b206fedecb8d991d85c6f82de0458be6fe07b6c346f4496d0b699aeb0ce346e", "ja": "……そっか。\nうん、わかった。自分も、全力でやる！", "zh": "……这样啊。\n嗯，我知道了。我自己也会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2038_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a67dfae50129e1e949686b3ba0f07689197340589e7a68e4b3e6e014fb2478fa", "ja": "そんな、我那覇さんまで……。", "zh": "怎么连我那霸小姐也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2039_047sub", "source_sha256": "f4ac6d0083f67252390a130a8ce7ae5470db112f7f91cffe0404dd3a81d93828", "ja": "もう、美希も響も何言ってるんだよ～。バック\nダンサーは、センターを盛り上げるのが役目だろ？", "zh": "真是的，美希和响都在说什么啊～。伴\n舞的职责，不就是让中心位热闹起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2040_003mik", "source_sha256": "ceb8d824b214a69b857317ac6de83e82c38cab44f2f99c35ce098e16aeb1993b", "ja": "そうだよ？\nだから、昴くんもがんばってね☆", "zh": "对呀？\n所以昴也要加油哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2041_047sub", "source_sha256": "aebac124abfcdef1cbf53aaafdfc08da26d3cb128de63105725a541d4fa8f8f0", "ja": "いや、なんで？　わかんないってばー！", "zh": "不是，凭什么啊？我完全搞不懂啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2042_013hib", "source_sha256": "03a9365c70ac9eceea797e0087c49e443a346096aff0dff08f19e45b92c19da8", "ja": "あ。さては昴も紬も、\n自分に負けるのが怖いんでしょー？", "zh": "啊，原来如此。昴和紬都是害怕输给我，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2043_047sub", "source_sha256": "6a6729417981f7cacef0320ecba1d7331691604a1d3d269b8d140c6040e2ca37", "ja": "うわ、なんでそうなるんだよ！　オレだって、\n本気でやれば……、め、目立てるんだからな！", "zh": "呜哇，怎么会变成这样啊！我只要认真起来……就、就也能引人注目的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2044_051tmg", "source_sha256": "54de6d068367c4c1b5a62f89da5fa65069527765ec02af6d0f57bd98853b9013", "ja": "ああ……みなさん、どうして……。\nうちは……。", "zh": "啊……大家，为什么……。\n我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2045_p", "source_sha256": "a88201b926254a7865eabec1d2ac696884fd76e520c442e291648c6ed8cda31c", "ja": "大丈夫だ、紬。何かあれば俺が責任を取る。\nだから紬も、全力でやってほしい！", "zh": "没事的，紬。要是出了什么事，有我来承担责任。\n所以我也希望紬能全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2046_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0f85e99e2ace94b1eaa4a864b121340c88c0bc4d86954df9b4e6fce767fe3f8b", "ja": "{$P$}……。わかりました。\nでは……信じます。信じて、私もやりきります！", "zh": "{$P$}……我明白了。\n那么……我相信您。我会相信您，也会全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2573d8615f584a1e519b0aefca709f513fcbaee4db456dc5b111b16455170a46", "ja": "やったー！　紬さん、よろしくお願いしま～す！\n楽しいステージにしましょうね♪", "zh": "太好啦——！紬小姐，请多关照～！\n我们一起打造一个开心的舞台吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_056_2048_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fcc14211a11a3ee9f96fc95566dc10a09e0d6fc56841ca955de1201eab2a8872", "ja": "楽し……。そうですね、楽しく……\n思いきり、楽しく……。", "zh": "开心……。是呢，开心地……\n尽情地，开心地……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
